msgid "CLI Overview"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/cli/cli_overview.rst:5
msgid ""
"CodeIgniter 4 provides built-in command **spark** and useful commands and"
" library. You can also create spark commands, and run controllers via "
"CLI."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/cli/cli_overview.rst:14
msgid "What is the CLI?"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/cli/cli_overview.rst:16
msgid ""
"The command-line interface is a text-based method of interacting with "
"computers. For more information, check the `Wikipedia article "
"<https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Command-line_interface>`_."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/cli/cli_overview.rst:22
msgid "Why Run via the Command-Line?"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/cli/cli_overview.rst:24
msgid ""
"There are many reasons for running CodeIgniter from the command-line, but"
" they are not always obvious."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/cli/cli_overview.rst:27
msgid "Run your cron-jobs without needing to use *wget* or *curl*."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/cli/cli_overview.rst:28
msgid ""
"Make interactive \"tasks\" that can do things like set permissions, prune"
" cache folders, run backups, etc."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/cli/cli_overview.rst:30
msgid ""
"Integrate with other applications in other languages. For example, a "
"random C++ script could call one command and run code in your models!"
msgstr ""

